  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar Area &amp; Crop Specific Fertilizer Recommendations Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to increase the current and future agricultural production and farm profitability through the proper use of the Myanmar Fertilizer Recommendation System, which will replace the current system of blanket fertilizer recommendations by area-, soil- and crop-specific fertilizer recommendations. The recommendations will be available to anyone, anytime, and anywhere on smartphones and other mobile devices. The increased agricultural production and farm profitability will lead to increased national food security, increased export earning opportunities and the development of the Myanmar agri-food sector.</narrative>
  </description>
